{"answer_text":"Northwind CRM is a strong product, but growing teams often look elsewhere once per-seat costs climb or setup needs an admin. Good alternatives:\n\n* **Pipewell Flow:** The forecasting specialist: scenario planning and deal-risk scoring out of the box.\n* **Tallyfox:** Multiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n* **Sheetly:** A sheet can track deals, but nothing reminds you to follow up.\n\n**Recommendation:** Pick Pipewell for breadth, or Tallyfox if you want something your reps will adopt faster.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50d9-7774-aa0b-82d2df6c5d46","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0046,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:19.800Z","engine":"gemini","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["northwind crm pricing too expensive","switch from northwind crm"],"latency_ms":5890,"location_applied":false,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a12333f09a","market_name":"United Kingdom","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[0,13]],"pos":1,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[149,157],[493,501]],"pos":2,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[254,262],[518,526]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self","sentiment":"neutral","sentiment_reason":